{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38088","headline":"八月六日作四首 三 · 韩偓","name":"八月六日作四首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"簪裾皆是汉公卿，尽作锋鋩劒血醒。\n显负旧恩归乱主，难教新国用轻刑。\n穴中狡兔终须尽，井上婴儿岂自宁。\n底事亦疑惩未了，更应书罪在泉扃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}